    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. 8mm film projector with two spoked reels (red feed, black take-up), a film strip threaded through the gate, lamp housing, ventilation grilles, control knobs, focus barrel, carry handle and a separate mains lead with plug. Rear and bottom views show finished panels and feet. Badge reads SIRIUS above a nonsense descriptor (steerling), matching the invented-brand pattern used elsewhere in this provider's catalogue.",
    "limitations": [
      "Invented SIRIUS steerling badge is baked into the texture; remove it for brand-sensitive use.",
      "Not rigged: the reels do not turn and the film does not advance.",
      "The mains plug is a specific regional type and may not match your scene's locale."
    ],
